  "title": "Jack's Triangle",
  "creator": "CrossFit",
  "description": "On a 23-minute clock for total reps: 2 minutes of max deadlifts at 225/155 lb, then a 19-minute AMRAP of 4 strict pull-ups, 11 box jumps to a 30/24 in box, 13 hand-release push-ups and a 23-calorie bike, then 2 more minutes of max deadlifts. Honours U.S. Marine Cpl. Kevin \"Jack\" Dempsey, 2nd Reconnaissance Battalion, killed by an IED in Al Anbar Province, Iraq, in 2004. Posted in 2026.",
